---
description: ContextForge project memory
alwaysApply: true
---

ContextForge is a local-first AI developer tool.

- Treat `.contextforge/` markdown memory as durable project state.
- Keep summaries compact and agent-friendly.
- Record decisions, bugs, failed attempts, and setup facts separately.
- Avoid cloud AI calls when privacy mode is `local`.
- Never assume repo scan facts if the scan is stale; rerun `npx contextforge scan`.
